# Routines as values, as modules use them: `.assuming`, signature and arity
# introspection, `&?ROUTINE`, pointy blocks and WhateverCode, `&infix:<...>`,
# `.&sub`, `state`, `wrap`, and the `return`/`fail` idioms.

=== sig-assuming-whatever-holes
from: HTTP::Tiny 0.2.6 lib/HTTP/Tiny.rakumod:593
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method assuming
--- code
sub data-callback($chunk, %response, $total) { "{%response<status>}: {$chunk.chars}/$total" }
my %response = status => 200;
my &on-content;
&on-content = &data-callback.assuming( *, %response, * );
say on-content('abcd', 10);
say &on-content.arity;
--- expect
200: 4/10
2

